      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but building your own meaning feels like a joke. it's just making up stories to distract yourself from the fact that everything ends. if the end result is always zero, why go through the effort of the struggle? it feels more like we're just pretending to have a purpose to cope with the terror of being nothing.",
